  "summary": "Streamline your cooking with this vibrant <b>Moroccan warm grain salad</b> prepared easily using just a single pot for effortless preparation and cleanup. Fluffy <b>dried couscous</b> and protein-rich <b>canned chickpeas</b> absorb a hot spiced broth infused with aromatic cumin, sweet cinnamon, and sea salt. Diced dried apricots rehydrate in the steam, adding subtle pockets of natural sweetness that pair beautifully with crunchy toasted sliced almonds. Everything steeps together directly in one pan, allowing the grains to expand and absorb all savory flavors without extra cookware. Once plumped, a bright dressing of lemon juice and extra virgin olive oil is folded in alongside fragrant torn fresh mint leaves. This colorful grain salad works wonderfully as a hearty main dish or a vibrant side for feasts, serving high flavor with minimal dishwashing. Enjoy it warm or chilled for a delightful light meal full of North African charm.",
