          "step": "Stir in dried couscous, chickpeas, and diced apricots, then remove from heat and cover tightly with a lid for ten minutes."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Dressing and Assembly",
      "steps": [
        {
          "number": 1,
          "step": "Fluff the steeped couscous gently with a fork to separate grains without mashing the tender chickpeas."
        },
        {
          "number": 2,
          "step": "Fold in fresh lemon juice, chopped mint, and toasted almonds directly in the pot, then serve immediately while warm."
        }
      ]
